The general solution is a sum of a [[Transient (oscillation)|transient]] solution that depends on initial conditions, and a [[steady state]] that is independent of initial conditions and depends only on the driving amplitude __MATH_1459__, driving frequency __MATH_1460__, undamped angular frequency __MATH_1461__, and the damping ratio __MATH_1462__.

